{
  "experimental__visibility-layout#bf26-nike": {
    "title": "Nike - On/Off",
    "children": [
      "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike",
      "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike-shelf"
    ],
    "props": {
      "visible": true
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike": {
    "title": "Nike - Container",
    "children": [
      "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike-inner"
    ],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": [
        "lp-black-2k26-split--gray",
        "lp-black-2k26-split--nike"
      ],
      "fullWidth": true
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike-inner": {
    "title": "Conteúdo",
    "children": ["flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-text", "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-media"],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": [
        "lp-black-2k26-split-container",
        "lp-black-2k26-split",
        "lp-black-2k26-nike"
      ]
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-text": {
    "title": "Texto - Coluna",
    "children": [
      "rich-text#bf26-nike-title",
      "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-1",
      "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-2",
      "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-3"
    ],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-split-text"
    }
  },

  "rich-text#bf26-nike-title": {
    "title": "Título",
    "props": {
      "text": "## black friday da **nike** na **magicfeet** o tênis infantil favorito com preço especial!",
      "blockClass": ["lp-black-2k26-ofertas-title"]
    }
  },

  "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-1": {
    "title": "Texto 1",
    "props": {
      "text": "a gente sabe que são os detalhes que completam o look e trazem ainda mais praticidade e alegria para o dia a dia, não é mesmo? o cuidado de escolher o acessório perfeito faz toda a diferença para o bem-estar dos pequenos.",
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-text"
    }
  },

  "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-2": {
    "title": "Texto 2",
    "props": {
      "text": "pensando nisso, a magicfeet preparou ofertas especiais em acessórios infantis que você não pode perder! seja para as aventuras na escola ou para os momentos de lazer, temos tudo o que seu filho precisa.",
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-text"
    }
  },

  "rich-text#bf26-nike-text-3": {
    "title": "Texto 3",
    "props": {
      "text": "nesta black friday, você encontra de tudo: aquela mochila infantil funcional para a volta às aulas, bonés cheios de estilo, meias confortáveis e chinelos super versáteis na **black friday!**",
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-text"
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-media": {
    "title": "Mídia - Coluna",
    "children": [
      "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike-collage"
    ],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-split-media"
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.row#bf26-nike-collage": {
    "title": "Colagem",
    "children": ["flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-collage-1", "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-collage-2"],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-collage"
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-collage-1": {
    "title": "Colagem - Coluna 1",
    "children": ["image#bf26-nike-img-1", "image#bf26-nike-img-2"],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-collage-col"
    }
  },

  "image#bf26-nike-img-1": {
    "title": "Imagem",
    "props": {
      "src": "assets/img/lp-black/nike-1.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "blockClass": ["lp-black-2k26-collage-img", "lp-black-2k26-collage-img--half"]
    }
  },

  "image#bf26-nike-img-2": {
    "title": "Imagem",
    "props": {
      "src": "assets/img/lp-black/nike-2.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "blockClass": ["lp-black-2k26-collage-img", "lp-black-2k26-collage-img--half"]
    }
  },

  "flex-layout.col#bf26-nike-collage-2": {
    "title": "Colagem - Coluna 2",
    "children": [
      "image#bf26-nike-img-3"
    ],
    "props": {
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-collage-col"
    }
  },

  "image#bf26-nike-img-3": {
    "title": "Imagem",
    "props": {
      "src": "assets/img/lp-black/nike-3.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "blockClass": "lp-black-2k26-collage-img"
    }
  }
}
